    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">curvus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-vŏs</span></b> ), a, um, adj.
		root kar-, whence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορώνη</span>; cf.:
			circus, varus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>crooked, curved, bent</i> (opp. rectus; mostly <b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aratrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 933</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">6, 1253</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				G. 1, 170</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rastri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">culter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Hippol. 53</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">falces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 508</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calamus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					63, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					5, 536</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 9, 114</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Am. 3, 10, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ungues,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 9, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hor. Epod. 5, 93</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lyra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					C. 1, 10, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 28, 11</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crinale,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					5, 53</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(equi) alvus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					1, 360</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cavernae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					3, 674</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				3</span></i>
			 (4), 7, 29: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 74</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3, 223</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 4,
				5, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Epod. 10, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 11,
				352</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spatium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. H. 4, 20</span></i>
			 Dietsch: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumen,</span>”
				<i>winding, crooked</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 12</span></i>
