					E. 3, 42</span></i>
			; and of one <i>bent by age</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				2</span></i>
			 (3), 18, 20: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">membra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 276</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">senecta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					A. 2, 670</span></i>
